### 用户注册（成功）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jjtq",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 用户名已存在：HTTP 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jjtq",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 参数校验失败：HTTP 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "j",
  "password": "123"
}

### 用户登录（成功）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jjtq",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 密码错误：HTTP 401
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jjtq",
  "password": "wrong123"
}
